{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id238922337"}, "name":{"label":"Nick-1983"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-26T01:53:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.7"}, "id":{"label":"13998292111"}, "title":{"label":"Good but needs something else to make it stand out even more"}, "content":{"label":"I keep coming back to this app but sometimes there is something it still needs to keep me using it…\n\nThe app has strong structure and works well for organising both work and personal routines, but it falls short when it comes to flexibility and personalisation. Managing recurring tasks is straightforward on a weekly basis, however it becomes inefficient when routines vary, such as alternating days off or changes in schedule. A key improvement would be the introduction of “template days” or “day types” (e.g. workday, day off, holiday, event day) that can be applied to any date, allowing tasks to adjust automatically without constant manual editing. In addition, notification options are limited—there should be the ability to add audio to tasks or customise notification sounds so important reminders stand out and are not missed. It would also be beneficial to have a clearer, dedicated notes area separated from tasks, allowing users to capture information, thoughts, or context without cluttering actionable items. These improvements would significantly reduce friction, improve consistency, and make the system far more practical for real-life use where schedules and priorities constantly shift.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
