{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id33254852"}, "name":{"label":"ClareEH"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-24T04:11:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.6"}, "id":{"label":"13881560652"}, "title":{"label":"Really great app, but I’d like more colour options"}, "content":{"label":"This app really helps keep me on track… I can sync my calendars to it, so I can see when appts overlap with my usual schedule and shuffle my day so everything fits.  \n\nMy only wish would be for a bigger variety of colour options… the selection of colours are not very attractive or varied, despite the sliders, and I’d really appreciate some on colour palette mood themes (bright, muted, pastel etc… with a good selection of complimentary colours for that theme).  I appreciate it’s the icing on the cake, but I’d love to be able to personalise the colour options more.\n\nOtherwise, love the app and thank you for helping keep me on track!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
