{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42080514"}, "name":{"label":"JMattBrock"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-13T04:37:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.5"}, "id":{"label":"13843325235"}, "title":{"label":"Not for me."}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoy the visual layout of Structured, but I’ve decided not to upgrade to Pro because the app lacks basic 'Location' and 'Travel Time' fields.\n\nAs someone with ADHD and dyslexia, I need a planner that accounts for the reality of my day, including the time it takes to get between appointments.\n\nCurrently, I have to go back to Apple Calendar for this, which makes the app feel like an extra step rather than a solution. \n\nAdding travel time would make this a must-have tool for me. \n\nHope to see this in a future update", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
