{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id33904132"}, "name":{"label":"ming.photographer"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-28T01:30:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.4"}, "id":{"label":"13797908107"}, "title":{"label":"Staying organised with ADHD"}, "content":{"label":"Staying organized and track of everything with my ADHD can be overwhelming. What Structured does is allow me to stay on top of things with very clean visual UI. How it syncs with calendars is amazing. Being able to plan in my days is really useful and makes organising my weeks a dream. The thing I find the most helpful is how it works across the Apple eco system. Using the desktop widget means I can keep up to date at a glance. The free version is really strong and recommend using it for a month to see if it works for you. I really enjoyed it and decided to pay for the life time subscription. Unlocking the calendar sync really made this worth every penny for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
