{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id987628096"}, "name":{"label":"hb8765"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-06T04:57:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"13719168069"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant app"}, "content":{"label":"Due to illness/disability my brain fog limits my daily life so much. Thanks to the creators of this app it’s made my life a lot easier. I’m waiting to upgrade to the pro version which hopefully will make life even easier for me once I can use emojis to recognize reminders etc. Thank you so much for your efforts. I highly recommend.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1170213127"}, "name":{"label":"Cheryl blossoms 🌸"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-05T12:52:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"13716925614"}, "title":{"label":"I love it ❤️❤️"}, "content":{"label":"I genuinely loved this checklist. From the very first use, it was clear how much care and thought went into creating it. Everything is laid out so clearly that it instantly made tasks feel easier, calmer, and more enjoyable to complete.\n\nWhat stood out most to me is how satisfying it is to use. Checking off each item felt motivating, and it helped me stay focused and confident the entire time. It didn’t just organise my work — it actually made me want to get things done.\n\nThis checklist exceeded my expectations in every way. It is practical, reliable, and honestly a pleasure to use. I would happily use it again and strongly recommend it to anyone looking for a tool that truly works. Five stars from me — outstanding performance and exceptional results ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
