{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1401141995"}, "name":{"label":"TaranSingh04"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-27T13:39:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"13682921774"}, "title":{"label":"Very Useful App but not great for one problem"}, "content":{"label":"Dear Sir/Madam,\n\nI’m writing to inform you of a very annoying issue I keep getting on the app. I’ve noticed the app learns suggestions based on tasks you create which is useful for creating tasks. However every task gets learnt and is then suggested on the tasks planning including tasks you don’t want to see multiple times and want to delete and tasks that you created and meant to delete after. Sadly, there’s no way to edit suggest tasks and kindly request you to add a feature to help with these options as over the time, this problem gets very annoying! I look forward to a reply for this problem and a solution please", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
